{"sourceUrl":"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/c4/41/c43776a771137/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:18.364017+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/c4/41/c43776a771137/page.htm","html":"<div><p><strong><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名现已正式开启，欢迎校内外广大优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式攻读我院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年博士生、硕士生！</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、学校及学院简介</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>华东师范大学</span></span></span><span><span><span>是教育部直属重点大学、国家</span></span></span><span><span><span>“双一流”、“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>211</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>工程”</span></span></span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>985</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>工程”</span></span></span><span><span><span>重点建设高校。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2017</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年，学校进入</span></span></span><span><span><span>世界一流大学</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>A</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>类建设高校</span></span></span><span><span><span>行列；</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年，入选第二轮国家“双一流”建设名单。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>下设药物科学系和药物工程系，现已拥有</span></span></span><span><span><span>药学一级学科博士点</span></span></span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span><span><span><span>生物与医药工程博士点</span></span></span><span><span><span>。学院依托华东师范大学在药学、计算机科学、化学、生物学、软件工程、统计学、心理学等强势学科优势，围绕</span></span></span><span><span><span>化学、基因、细胞、数字四类药物</span></span></span><span><span><span>，重点发展</span></span></span><span><span><span>人工智能药学 、药物智造、数字药物、生物药物与递送系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>等前沿技术和方向，通过多学科的交叉融合，培养“全面而自由”的面向国际前沿和国家战略需求的高精尖缺“药学英才”。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>在人才培养方面，自</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月开始，至今已有</span></span></span><span><span><span>约</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>200</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>名在读研究生和博士生</span></span></span><span><span><span>。在合作交流方面，现已与</span></span></span><span><span><span>十余家生物医药事业单位或企业签订了合作协议</span></span></span><span><span><span>。并与</span></span></span><span><span><span>多家上市药企签约合作共建药学联合实验室</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>多家合作企业专门设置了奖学金</span></span></span><span><span><span>，定向支持药学院的人才培养工作。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>其他信息详见药学院官网：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/main.htm</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、报名条件及要求</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/>1.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>药学、化学、生命科学、计算机、软件、数学、物理、机械等相关专业</span></span></span><span><span><span>，已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求；</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>    三、招生专业与导师</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>导师情况可通过</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>药</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学院网站相应页面了解</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/46313/list.htm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，点击进入导师个人主页查阅信息。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>申报类别</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学位类别</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>研究方向</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学制</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>硕士</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>100700</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span><span><span><span>包括药物化学、药理学、药剂学、人工智能药学、药物智造、数字药物、生物药物与递送系统、制药工程、生物技术与工程等</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span>直博生</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>100700</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><a href=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/c4/41/c43776a771137/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）（工程硕博士培养改革专项，与临港实验室联合培养）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span>注：以上学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我校</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，以下简称推免服务系统）公布为准。</span></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>直博生报考相关说明：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>直博生入学后适用博士研究生的管理规章制度，享受博士研究生的同等待遇，履行博士研究生的相关义务。本方案未尽事宜请遵照当年度博士招生章程执行。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>四、报名方式与要求</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>考生需通过我校研究生报考服务系统（网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）报名。每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名起止时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>27</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9:00--9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>23:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。在报名截止前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>请考生按照系统要求提交材料，同时须保证提交材料真实、准确，无弄虚作假、学术不端。如发现申请材料有虚假成分，立即取消申请人一切资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>五、注意事项</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名后，</span></span></span><span><span><span>请务必密切关注邮箱，我院复试通知将以邮件的形式通知。未接到复试通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>最终信息以中国研究生招生信息网（网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）、学校研招网另行公布为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读学校</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年博士、硕士研究生者均须在正式取得推免生资格，且在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）开通后，另履行正式的填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等程序。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>如错过预报名，可待上述教育部系统开通后直接报名；学院将结合实际确定是否再次组织推免招生复试考核与录取。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>咨询联系方式：何老师邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>yanjiusheng@pharm.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，电话</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>13371859379</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（学院暑假轮休期间，建议优先通过电子邮件方式咨询）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>咨询时间：周一至周五，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9:00-11:30,13:00-17:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>监督申诉渠道：陈老师邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:cchen@sfs.ecnu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span>cchen@sfs.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>请密切关注学校研招网及学院官方通知、资讯。</span>